## Understanding Free Tier Limits

Free models on OpenRouter have two types of limits:

| Limit type | What it means | Reset time |
|---|---|---|
| Rate limit | Max requests per minute (~20 req/min) | Minutes |
| Daily token budget | Max tokens per day per model | Every 24 hours |
| Sponsored budget | Total tokens provider allocates | Topped up periodically |

**What this means in practice:**
- Light daily coding tasks (bug fixes, small features): works great
- Large codebase analysis or long sessions: you may hit limits faster
- If one model is exhausted, switch to another — limits are per model

